    "$t": "櫻花"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b><b>黃芳儀</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寒--人ê跤步</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">漸漸離開</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī tsit个路途</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">遙遠ê山區</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">　　leh落粉紅仔色ê雨</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一點一點</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一片一片</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tuè風吹--來</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就親像</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">粉紅仔色ê尾蝶仔</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī天頂跳舞</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">真濟人攑頭leh看</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kā手機仔提--出-來</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hip相</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">展出</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">歡喜ê笑容</span></p><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicRzhuNfvQrLjHSz4rE7C-AGivX0wBkqONhorsZkLI0tEBAX_5cuafLrBVMvwKXjDumnKQbovF-_VEJYRqwK2V1ZS3VhY5YhLh1BNbZ6ebELP7o3VSUPZJC3VxP7LAxaW3f8C4G0Vy9N8WNu8uymmnbBiE7XzBsDJ_bSMw9-2c7SpugdQkZ1r-xsCaUw/s1421/338%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEicRzhuNfvQrLjHSz4rE7C-AGivX0wBkqONhorsZkLI0tEBAX_5cuafLrBVMvwKXjDum